[25.387953, "o", "  \u001b[1m§VI  \u001b[0mEffect rows enforced by type system — not by convention.\r\n       Wrong row → compile error, not a runtime surprise.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m§VIII\u001b[0mHash chain detects deleted event via seq gap.\r\n       Tampered log is structurally detectable.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m"]
